input:
De vacaciones y sin ganas de cocinar, decidimos (x8) pedir pizzas en este lugar para retirar y comer en el lugar en el que nos estábamos hospedando, que quedaba a 500 metros. Así que, un jueves de verano, las fuimos a buscar cerca de las 21.30 horas.
Entramos y nos pareció muy ameno, limpio y confortable para comer ahí. Nos atendió un hombre muy amable y atento.
Pedimos los siguientes sabores:
- prosciutto (jamón crudo);
- ham (jamón cocido);
- pepperoni;
- cebolla;
- hongos;
- anchoas y
- albahaca y tomate.

Las pizzas tardaron 25/30 minutos. Todos sus gustos -de los cuales subo foto- estuvieron deliciosos. El estilo de pizza fue a la piedra, con salsa de tomate y queso muzzarela en una cantidad ideal.
Si bien este comentario parece limitarse únicamente a una estricta relación precio-calidad, no menos verdad es que, en mi opinión, la calidez con la que fuimos recibidos reflejó cómo hubiera sido el trato de haber decidido cenar ahí mismo.
No dudo en valorar a este lugar con cinco estrellas.

Help me polish this:
While on vacation and not feeling like cooking, we decided (x8) to order pizzas from this place for takeout and eat at the place where we were staying, which was only 500 meters away. So, on a summer Thursday, we went to pick them up around 9:30pm.

Upon entering, we found the place to be very pleasant, clean, and comfortable for dining in. We were attended by a very friendly and attentive man.

We ordered the following flavors:
- prosciutto (raw ham);
- ham (cooked ham);
- pepperoni;
- onion;
- mushrooms;
- anchovies; and
- basil and tomato.

The pizzas took about 25/30 minutes to make. All of the flavors - of which I have uploaded a photo - were delicious. The style of pizza was thin crust, with a perfect amount of tomato sauce and mozzarella cheese.

Although this review may seem to only focus on the strict price-quality relationship, it is also true that, in my opinion, the warmth with which we were received reflected how the experience would have been if we had decided to dine on-site.

I have no hesitation in giving this place a five-star rating.
